acing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:24px;padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:24px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"> </td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;line-height:1.7;color:#486b73;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center\">Leave the busy day at the door. Your visit can be as unhurried as you need it to be.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;background-color:#fcffff\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0 18px\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://assets.weavour.com/templates/spa-retreat/hero-2df5ead0f316.jpg\" alt=\"A sun-washed coastal hotel terrace with a stone arch framing the sea.\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:0px;display:inline-block;width:100%;height:auto;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;object-fit:contain\"/></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;background-color:#fcffff\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 36px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.08;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:400;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#173f4a;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-left:0;padding-right:0;overflow-wrap:break-word;text-align:center\">ARRIVE SLOWLY</h2><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:16px;padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:16px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"> </td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;line-height:1.7;color:#486b73;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center\">Settle in with tea before changing for the pool and quiet rooms.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;background-color:#fcffff\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 36px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.08;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:400;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#173f4a;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-left:0;padding-right:0;overflow-wrap:break-word;text-align:center\">CHOOSE YOUR TREATMENT</h2><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:16px;padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:16px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"> </td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;line-height:1.7;color:#486b73;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center\">Browse the treatment menu and discuss preferences with your therapist.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;background-color:#fcffff\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 36px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.08;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:400;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#173f4a;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-left:0;padding-right:0;overflow-wrap:break-word;text-align:center\">STAY FOR LUNCH</h2><table role=\"presentatio